# @name: jq | Create New Object
# @description: Creates a new object with selected fields Group: JQ Advanced Operations. Template: replace placeholders before running. {new_field1} = Name for first new field | {field1} = Source field for first new field | {new_field2} = Name for second new field | {field2} = Source field for second new field | {json_file} = Path to JSON file or '-' for stdin
jq '{{new_field1}: .{field1}, {new_field2}: .{field2}}' {json_file}